  aciklama:
  - "De\u011Ferli {{isim}}, senin {{sayi,4,6}} hafta sonra \xE7i\xE7ek\xE7iye yolun
    d\xFC\u015Fecek. Biri i\xE7in san\u0131r\u0131m \xF6zel bir g\xFCn. Normalde
    ba\u015Fka insanlar\u0131n vermekten \xE7ekinece\u011Fi bir mebla\u011F \xF6deyerek
    g\xFCzel bir \xE7i\xE7ek yapt\u0131racaks\u0131n. Dikey b\u0131y\u0131k kal\u0131nl\u0131\u011F\u0131
    seninki gibi ortalama \xFCst\xFC olanlar bonk\xF6r olur. K\u0131sa sakall\u0131
    {{burc}} bur\xE7lar\u0131 i\xE7in {{ay_1}} ve {{ay_2}} aylar\u0131n\u0131n sevgi
    dolu ge\xE7ece\u011Fini de d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCrsek, \"i\xE7 \u0131s\u0131tan\"
    zamanlar ya\u015Fayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6ylemek m\xFCmk\xFCn."
